WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:10.990
When you’re done with that,
you’re doing the rest of your homework.

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:15.740
What? Can’t I just copy your answers?

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:18.080
You already know the answer is no.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.340
Himawari!

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.550
I want to express my genuine gratitude to our seniors!

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:38.550
Are you really Sakurako?!

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:41.100
How rude!

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:45.940
Because, they’re always so nice to me.

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:49.900
They always finish up the work I didn’t do because I was goofing off,

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.800
they even wipe up the crumbs I leave after eating!

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:56.580
Maybe instead of showing gratitude you should beg for forgiveness.

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:58.490
Especially Sugiura-senpai!

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:00.240
Y’know how she shares her pudding with me?

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:03.700
Oh.... um... you can have it then...

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:06.290
Hooray! Thank you!

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:08.890
She lets me have it even though it’s her favorite!

00:01:08.890 --> 00:01:10.160
Isn’t that amazing?

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:16.460
I’ll invite them over and prepare a royal reception!

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:20.280
Exactly what is pudding worth in your world?

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:24.890
In that case, how about cooking a banquet?

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:28.680
Wow! For you that’s a pretty good idea, Himawari!

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:31.760
What should I make though?

00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:33.980
Well...

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:36.610
How about a favorite dish of yours?

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.350
You mean delivery pizza?

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:39.990
Try again.

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:45.230
Yuru Yuri is starting!

00:01:48.850 --> 00:02:00.400
NACHUYACHUMI! +
<b>Yuru Yuri</b>

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:04.020
yuru yuru I'm a nonki na lady
Yuru Yuri. I’m a carefree lady,

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:06.940
kyoumo kibun ha joujousa baby
my spirits are higher than ever now, baby.

00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:09.760
nandakanda ittatte otoshigoro fourteen
After all’s said and done we’re fourteen,

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:12.980
so we are junior high school students
so we are junior high school students!

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:15.900
yuri yuri You are girly na tenshi
Yuru Yuri. You are a girly angel,

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:18.840
hair ga chotto nabiite cutie
hair aflutter, you are a cutie!

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:21.460
sansan kyoumo ii tenki da nihonbare
It’s a grand old sunny bright day!

00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:23.260
minnade wasshoi saa wasshoi
Everyone now: Wasshoi! Wasshoi!

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:25.160
rashurashurashu
Rush! Rush! Rush!

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:27.740
asobitsukarete kaettanara
Coming home from a long day of play,

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:30.680
ofuro ga iiyu da na
a hot bath sounds like just the thing.

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:33.860
ichidokirino jinseidakara
You only get to live once,

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:36.780
tamerawazuni hora chuucho ha yamete
so don’t hesitate, don’t fret.

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:38.980
imasugu tobidase
No time to think, just fly!

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:41.760
jinsei ha happy taidani baibee
Life is happy, so don’t be idle,

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:44.930
sunawachi happy go lucky de iijan
just be happy-go-lucky - why not?

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:48.440
ikitomattara hitomazu ocha demo nonde
If we come to a roadblock we can sit a moment and have tea,

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:50.760
rashurashurashushushu de OK
Rush! Rush! Rush! OK!

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:53.760
isseinose de goukaini diving
Get on your marks, and take a bold dive,

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:56.960
sunawachi nichijou koso daibouken
our every single day is an adventure!

00:02:56.960 --> 00:03:00.410
amai aisu no youni toroketeku mainichi
The days go by like sweet ice cream melting.

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:02.990
rashurashurashushushude OK sa
Rush! Rush! Rush! OK!

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:06.080
otonaninattemo wasurenai
Even when we grow up we won’t forget this,

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:09.960
yurishurashurashushushu
Lily shu-ra-shu-ra-shu-shu-shu!

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:20.260
What happened to the “pon”?!

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:21.130
Yo.

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:26.650
Akari and Chinatsu-chan aren’t here yet?

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:28.120
You’re here too early.

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:30.830
There’s still about 20-30 minutes.

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:34.330
In that case, we should play Namo Bros.
while we’re waiting!

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:36.220
Summer vacation’s over soon.

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:38.740
Shouldn’t you be starting your homework around now?

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:41.640
Yeah, but I can do that whenever.

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:42.260
Same goes for games.

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:47.620
Oh, I think I get it. You’re scared of losing.

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:48.860
Yeah, right.

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:51.850
I’ve been training extra hard just to beat you up.

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:02.360
I’ve got to see these skills you have for myself.

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:08.830
Now loading...

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:18.820
One hit kill?!

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:25.260
I’ll get you this time!

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:28.740
Oh, a hammer!

00:04:35.530 --> 00:04:38.550
Very odd. Somehow I didn’t win.

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:41.280
Rematch!

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:52.300
I won! I beat Yui!

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:55.050
Finally! Victory at last!

00:04:55.050 --> 00:04:55.670
Come on. You’re getting a little too excited.

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:58.040
Yes, yes! I finally beat Yui!

00:04:58.040 --> 00:04:59.250
Next round, let’s go.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.500
I lost again...

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:09.260
Gotcha.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:14.760
Hold on, did I see a fist pump?

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:17.590
Were you slightly bothered when I won the other round?

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:20.050
You were, weren’t you?

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:21.600
Shut up.

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:23.650
Oh, I knew it.

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:28.260
Welcome.

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:29.890
Excuse us!

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:33.720
Just now, I had a little taste of Yui’s humiliation.

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:35.480
What... is that?!

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:38.020
Don’t say it in such a weird way.

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:40.210
I just lost in a game is all.

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:43.650
Oh, don’t scare me like that.

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:45.190
Well, I’m using the bathroom.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:51.920
What is it?

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:55.300
Why don’t we take a picture of Kyouko asleep?

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:57.360
Asleep?

00:05:57.360 --> 00:06:00.200
I mean, when we went camping she took pictures of all of us,

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:01.860
but nobody got a picture of her.

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.030
I get it!

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:06.200
We’ll want a full collection for the album!

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:11.060
Then, we’ll play with her lots after dinner to tire her out, and then...

00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:12.200
All right!

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:18.640
Were you... talking about me?

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:23.610
Hello.

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:26.120
Welcome!

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:28.370
Please, right this way.

00:06:28.370 --> 00:06:31.570
Excuse us.

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:38.720
Sorry... for...  the wait...

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:40.940
You poured too much!

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:42.850
I just wanted to make sure...

00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:44.280
that you guys would have...

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:45.990
enough to drink...

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:51.050
And here’s yours, Himawari.

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:52.390
So little!

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:58.360
Well I poured so much...
I don’t have any left for myself.

00:06:58.360 --> 00:07:01.480
I perhaps should have taught you about moderation.

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:07.060
This vaguely menacing rice omelet...

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:10.280
Is this because of earlier?

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:13.320
Look, I’m sorry it came out so badly! The ketchup exploded, okay?

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:17.090
You don’t want any drawing on your omelet?

00:07:17.090 --> 00:07:18.980
I prefer my omelets without ketchup actually.

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:21.540
Look, mine came out really nicely!

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:25.320
Nice one, Akari.

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.470
Mine is just perfect!

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:37.730
Thanks for the meal!

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:41.960
I really ate.

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:43.670
Can you wrap up the salad?

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:46.820
Hey YO! My belly so full yo!

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:48.900
I said “wrap.”

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:51.970
I’d like to thank my folks!

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:54.160
No thanks for the omelet?

00:07:57.350 --> 00:07:58.610
This one!

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:01.510
Ugh, the old maid.

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:03.060
Not again.

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:04.790
It’s too bad.

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.670
Oh, look at the time.

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:11.050
Should we have dinner?

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:13.340
Yes, please.

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:14.430
Roger Dodger!

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:18.430
Here we go! I call it “Sakurako-chan Curry!”

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:21.390
It looks good.

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:24.100
Thanks for the food!

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:36.120
Delicious!

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:52.130
I wonder what the secret ingredient is?

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:53.010
I wonder.

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:55.260
The meat is so tender!

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:55.970
Su—

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:58.930
Sugiura-senpai, this is for you!

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:00.810
You don’t want it?

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.040
I don’t.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:03.020
<i>It doesn’t seem like it.</i>

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:04.360
Well, I have a lo—

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:05.700
Please accept!

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:07.090
In that case...

00:09:09.990 --> 00:09:11.230
Do you like it?

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:16.370
Then please, take this!

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:20.370
And this. And this.

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:21.620
This goes here.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:26.120
And this. And this. One more!

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:30.000
<i>Wai— Slow down!</i>

00:09:35.610 --> 00:09:38.700
My stomach is pumping like a pompadour.

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:40.990
She did feed you all that.

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:42.660
We’ve got dessert too!

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:45.780
Um, maybe not now...

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:47.540
Why don’t we take a break?

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:49.840
Good idea!

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:51.990
In that case let’s do some gaming!

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:53.480
Crossing Animal: Wild City Leaf!

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:57.400
Oh, but I didn’t bring my portable.

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:00.900
I am prepared for this contingency.

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:02.690
I borrowed my sister’s!

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:06.760
That’s pretty prescient, for you.

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:13.570
Now that we’re done eating, it’s time for games!

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:15.570
Wait, what about the summer homework?

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:18.720
That’s right: games it will be.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:19.700
You’re not even listening.

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:27.270
Akari Town is getting lively, lots of shops are opening!

00:10:28.050 --> 00:10:30.440
Not Akkarin Town?

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:32.110
I don’t like that name!

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:34.230
What’s this then?

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:35.460
Welcome!

00:10:37.060 --> 00:10:38.070
What is that?

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:41.000
A present for you!

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:45.380
Also, I planted some flowers in Yui’s Kilimanjaro Town.

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:48.750
Could you plant in moderation?!

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:51.940
I’m not sure if you should thank that villager or kick her out...

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:54.820
It’s pretty though.

00:10:54.820 --> 00:10:56.360
Right?

00:10:56.360 --> 00:11:02.200
The interior of my house is lovey-dovey in preparation for Yui-senpai’s visit!

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:03.760
I-Is that so...?

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:05.270
Please come see!

00:11:05.270 --> 00:11:05.930
Sure.

00:11:08.470 --> 00:11:10.390
This is my—

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:13.250
Oh yeah, I dug that hole.

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:15.120
Cut it out!

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:17.610
I fell too!

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:36.700
Oh, that’s good.

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:40.080
Yui-senpai made it, after all.

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:42.010
Hey, how about we play a mini game?

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:44.560
I’m game!

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:46.310
How about we go online?

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:47.400
OK!

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:50.750
Isn’t it kind of exciting to play against someone you don’t know?

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:53.630
<b>Barley Tea</b>

00:11:54.260 --> 00:11:56.050
I’ll help you with that.

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:58.850
I’m... all... right.

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:02.200
We’re home.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.960
Welcome home.

00:12:03.960 --> 00:12:05.510
I hope you’ll excuse me being here.

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:07.280
Hey, Himako.

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.330
We’ve got curry today.

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:11.500
It’s my special Sakurako-chan Curry.

00:12:12.180 --> 00:12:13.560
Curry?

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:14.170
Must be ready-made.

00:12:15.810 --> 00:12:18.170
Sakurako went the extra mile and cooked it from scratch.

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:19.410
What?

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:26.970
Sorry for the wait!

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:28.390
Thanks.

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:28.930
No problem.

00:12:29.840 --> 00:12:33.010
Now then, did you make any progress?

00:12:33.010 --> 00:12:34.480
Yes, a little.

00:12:35.510 --> 00:12:36.980
Excuse me.

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:40.480
Wow, this clothes shop is cute!

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:42.440
Welcome!

00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:05.300
I see you have no patience in-game either.

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:09.030
Let’s fight a team of players online!

00:13:09.030 --> 00:13:09.890
Good idea!

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:11.280
Waiting for opponents to connect
The Bug Catchers' Championship

00:13:11.280 --> 00:13:13.920
The other team looks pretty cute.

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:14.850
I agree.

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:17.760
We win by catching more, right?

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:19.140
I’ll catch lots.

00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:21.940
Teamwork is the way—Zimbab-way!

00:13:22.640 --> 00:13:25.600
Slowly...

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:29.680
I did it! I got the cross animal butterfly!

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:32.020
Wow, that’s a rare catch!

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:34.250
This is an assured win.

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:36.300
It’s only got to do with the catch count.

00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:39.250
And we’re neck and neck.

00:13:51.110 --> 00:13:52.390
A pitfall?

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:56.690
I fell too.

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:59.540
Sakurako, you...

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:03.280
I thought I could sabotage the enemy...

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:06.040
That won’t work if you dig them around your teammates!

00:14:06.040 --> 00:14:07.580
Fill them in.

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:11.260
I don’t really remember where I dug them.

00:14:11.260 --> 00:14:13.440
What do you think you’re doing?

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:16.710
You can’t just laugh it off!

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:20.230
They’re fighting?

00:14:20.230 --> 00:14:22.080
No, it must be some sort of ruse.

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:25.670
They don’t seem to understand the importance of teamwork.

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:27.970
You’re saying that?

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:30.660
What are you doing down there, Akari?

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:32.930
Kyouko-chan! Why are you holding that shovel?

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:35.760
You better cut that out.

00:14:35.760 --> 00:14:37.330
Sorry.

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:42.520
The bath’s open.

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:45.480
Oh, Sakurako.

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:47.560
She must have been tired.

00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:49.570
She looks comfortable.

00:14:49.960 --> 00:14:56.860
She woke up earlier than usual because she wanted to prepare for your visit.

00:14:56.860 --> 00:14:58.040
I see.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:00.960
The food was delicious.

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:03.000
I had a bit too much though.

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:03.750
Sorry about that.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:07.520
She said something about paying you back for the pudding.

00:15:07.520 --> 00:15:08.720
Pudding?

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:13.140
You always share with her,

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:16.560
so she wanted to treat you her favorite food.

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:22.160
She was all pumped up saying she’d cook the curry she learned on the camp.

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:23.520
I see.

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:28.480
It’s so nice to have such considerate friends.

00:15:28.480 --> 00:15:30.380
Thank you too, Furutani-san.

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:31.450
Not at all.

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:34.300
Okay, I’ll take a bath next.

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:35.330
I’ll show you the way.

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:37.360
Thank you.

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:50.720
Let’s have pudding together some time.

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:54.090
That was refreshing!

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:01.440
Wow, it’s late.

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:04.310
Are you tired?!

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:06.460
Um... not particularly.

00:16:06.460 --> 00:16:09.320
She always sleeps late.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:11.880
We’ll have to resort to drastic measures.

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:13.380
What’s your plan?

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:14.450
Leave it to me.

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:16.660
Kyouko-senpai.

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:19.160
I will sumo wrestle you.

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:19.640
Why?!

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:21.980
Yes.

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:23.350
She’s on board?!

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:25.580
Hakkeyoi!

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:28.300
Nokotta!

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:33.920
I think she’s trying to tire her out?

00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:35.180
That must be it.

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:37.570
Go, Chinatsu-chan!

00:16:37.570 --> 00:16:38.140
Dosukoi!

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:41.490
<i>Is this how sumo wrestling works?</i>

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:45.560
Winner!

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:48.690
C-Congratulations...

00:16:50.460 --> 00:16:52.650
Man, all this exercise...

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:55.200
I feel really awake!

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:56.950
<i>Whoops.</i>

00:16:57.460 --> 00:16:59.140
<i>And I tried so hard...</i>

00:17:00.020 --> 00:17:03.620
Oh yeah. Let’s do homework!

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:05.640
Why?!

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:08.040
We’ll forget otherwise.

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:15.910
I knew it.

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:17.510
Nicely done, Yui-chan.

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:19.220
Should we take it now?

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:23.680
She’s sleeping too lightly still.

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:26.310
Kyouko-chan, if you sleep here you’ll catch a cold.

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:27.760
Let’s get you to the futon.

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:37.880
It’s too early to go to sleep...

00:17:37.880 --> 00:17:40.450
You can just wake earlier to make up the playing time.

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:45.410
Go to sleep.

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:47.870
We’ll play again tomorrow...

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:49.720
Three fluffy sheep...

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:51.340
It seems to be working.

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:55.300
I think she’s completely asleep...

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:58.500
Akari-chan, wake up!

00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:00.790
This is our shutter chance!

00:18:01.570 --> 00:18:04.020
She does usually sleep around now...

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:09.000
We can’t photograph her like this!

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:09.940
One moment.

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:21.780
Rum raisin?

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:24.600
Isn’t that only sold in the winter?

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:27.760
Kyouko stashes them for the summer here.

00:18:28.310 --> 00:18:31.000
Exactly how much does she like rum raisin?

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:37.460
Rum raisin!

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:38.010
There we go.

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:40.660
I think we can go with that.

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:43.140
The rum raisin was surprisingly effective.

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:45.930
And now she is ready to be photographed.

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:50.210
Wum waisin...

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:51.610
I don’t believe it!

00:18:56.560 --> 00:18:58.530
Okay, now she’s back.

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:01.650
Akari-chan, you did a good job!

00:19:01.650 --> 00:19:03.090
Thanks a lot.

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:05.740
Okay, now let’s take that photo.

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:12.170
Me too.

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:17.110
Say cheese.

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:25.220
Mission accomplished.

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:26.480
Good job, team.

00:19:26.480 --> 00:19:28.130
You especially, Yui-senpai!

00:19:28.130 --> 00:19:31.540
Now we can complete the sleeping photo collection.

00:19:35.990 --> 00:19:39.170
Jeez, I can’t believe she took all these.

00:19:39.170 --> 00:19:41.450
Nobody even noticed.

00:19:43.140 --> 00:19:45.520
This one never gets old.

00:19:45.520 --> 00:19:47.510
Come on, Chinatsu-chan.

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:51.750
But I guess I don’t mind.

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:54.630
It’s a bit embarrassing but at least it’s a good memory.

00:19:54.630 --> 00:20:00.590
I’m so happy to be... with...

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:03.140
Akari-chan’s out of batteries!

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:04.930
I think she’s been struggling to stay awake.

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:07.920
Maybe we should go to sleep too.

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:09.250
I guess you’re right.

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:18.860
What?!

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:20.820
You were taking pictures?

00:20:21.510 --> 00:20:24.400
It’s what you get for taking those pictures before.

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:27.520
We turned you face up with some rum raisin.

00:20:27.520 --> 00:20:29.160
Wow, thanks a lot, Yui.

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:33.880
It’s not fair. You should have let me in on the action.

00:20:33.880 --> 00:20:35.670
If we did that we couldn’t have taken the photo.

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:40.710
Well whatever. Oh yeah, I got some pics too.

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:48.260
Pacifier... Kelp...!

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:52.980
Dammit, Akari-chan. Stop eating my twintails...

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:54.480
When did you—

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:58.450
It’s ‘cause you put me to bed so early!

00:20:58.450 --> 00:20:58.940
Delete those!

00:20:59.760 --> 00:21:03.250
No way! These are precious camping memories!

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:05.910
What does it have to do with camping?!

00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:12.320
Sleeping in again, huh?

00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:14.800
They’re already up.

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:16.900
Is that so...

00:21:18.220 --> 00:21:20.780
Setting aside your laziness...

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:23.150
I’m not sure I like the way you’re talking...

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:26.590
I wanna do this again!

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:29.640
I wonder what we’ll eat next time...

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:30.630
Pizza maybe?

00:21:30.630 --> 00:21:32.430
You’re really bent on pizza.

00:21:33.280 --> 00:21:35.110
Good morning.

00:21:35.110 --> 00:21:36.320
Morning.

00:21:36.320 --> 00:21:38.250
Thank you for yesterday.

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:39.980
That was some good curry.

00:21:41.090 --> 00:21:42.360
I’m glad.

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:46.590
Here you go, Oomuro-san.

00:21:46.590 --> 00:21:49.000
I bought this earlier.

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:50.010
We can share.

00:21:50.010 --> 00:21:51.540
Really?!

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:52.990
Yes!

00:21:56.600 --> 00:21:57.860
I love it!

00:21:57.860 --> 00:22:00.260
You really seem to be enjoying it.

00:22:00.260 --> 00:22:02.440
That’s because it’s so good!

00:22:26.550 --> 00:22:32.090
We roll around lazily in Saturn's rings
doseino wakkani gorogoro nekoronde

00:22:32.220 --> 00:22:37.890
then gorge ourselves on plump, round Mars takoyaki.
manmaru takoyaki kaseiwo hoobatte

00:22:38.020 --> 00:22:43.650
Forget everything and take a carefree trip together.
konomama minnade yurayura tabiwo shite

00:22:43.770 --> 00:22:49.320
Smiling all the way to the edge of the Milky Way.
gingano hatedemo isshyoni waraou

00:22:49.450 --> 00:22:55.080
A grand adventure that begins with a yawn.
akubide mata hajimaru daibouken

00:22:55.160 --> 00:23:00.750
A nice warm passport to our own paradise.
pokapoka gokurakuheno pasupo-to

00:23:00.830 --> 00:23:06.460
These brilliant sparkling days are shooting stars.
kirakira sugiru hibiha nagareboshi

00:23:06.590 --> 00:23:12.180
As we embrace our affection like a big fluffy pillow.
choppiri koigokorowo dakimakura

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:17.890
Even though the moon is so high in the starry sky.
hoshizora annani tsukiga takainoni

00:23:18.020 --> 00:23:29.320
I wonder if it's your fault that I can't sleep.
kimino seikana? nazeka nemurenai

00:23:35.160 --> 00:25:00.000
...I can't sleep.
nemurenai
